# DevPreview — Agent Instructions

## What is DevPreview?

DevPreview is an open-source, CLI-first developer tool that turns a local development server into a temporary shareable HTTPS URL.

The primary workflow is:

```bash
npx devpreview
```

```text
Detect local app
      ↓
Create temporary tunnel
      ↓
Print public HTTPS URL
      ↓
Developer shares it
```

The product should feel like:

> **"localhost, but shareable."**

